msgstr "Klik bagian disk pikeun ngagunakeun, réskalakeun, atanapi hapus. Parobahan ukur direncanakeun di dieu; teu aya nu ditulis nepi ka dikonfirmasi dina layar tinjauan."

#: src/ui/pages/destination_page.cpp
msgid "Pick a disk, then decide how it is laid out. Nothing is written to any device until you confirm on the review screen."
msgstr "Pilih disk, tuluy mutuskeun kumaha diaturna. Teu aya nu ditulis ka parangkat nu mana waé nepi ka dikonfirmasi dina layar tinjauan."

#: src/ui/pages/destination_page.cpp
msgid ""
"Automatic lays the system out for you: a boot partition, the system, your files and swap. If the disk already holds Windows or another system, you can install beside it; drag the slider to share the space.\n"
"\n"
"Custom opens the disk editor: click free space to add a mount point (at least “/”), or click a partition to use it, resize it or delete it. Advanced also offers LVM, RAID and Btrfs volumes.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is written to the disks until you begin the installation on the review screen."
msgstr ""
"Otomatis ngatur sistem pikeun Ibu/Bapa: partisi boot, sistem, berkas Ibu/Bapa jeung swap. Mun disk geus ngandung Windows atanapi sistem séjén, Ibu/Bapa tiasa masang gigireunana; sered slider pikeun babagi rohangan.\n"
"\n"
"Khusus muka éditor disk: klik rohangan kosong pikeun nambahkeun titik pamasangan (sahanteuna “/”), atanapi klik partisi pikeun ngagunakeun, réskalakeun, atanapi hapus. Lanjutan ogé nawaran volume LVM, RAID jeung Btrfs.\n"
"\n"
"Teu aya nu ditulis ka disk nepi ka Ibu/Bapa ngamimitian pamasangan dina layar tinjauan."

